=== BuffetN2 ===

A wooden buffet with some drawers hanging out, crooked. One of the cabinets appears to have a chipped handle.

    -> BuffetChoicesN2

=== BuffetChoicesN2 ===

    +[Open the drawers.]
        -> Drawers
    +[Open the cabinets.]
        -> Cabinets
    +[Leave]
        -> END

=== Drawers ===

You rummage through and find a collection of <b>dinosaur</b> figurines on top of some slightly unsettling looking dolls.

The dolls look a lot newer in quality compared to the scratched, obviously played with dinos.

    -> BuffetChoicesN2

=== Cabinets ===

Inside appear to be a set of three <b>human-like</b> figurines made of Play-Doh.

They’re incredibly cold to the touch and as hard as rocks.

    -> BuffetChoicesN2